	(text "U401: VOUT = 1.23 V x (1 + R402 / R403) = 13.5 V, 1.6 MHz.\nU402: VOUT = 100 uA x R404 = 12.0 V; PG opens above 11 V (R405, R406).\nU403: VOUT = -1.22 V x (R409 + R410) / R410 = -3.98 V; R408 keeps VBUS transients off its 5.8 V rating.\nPWR_GOOD is pulled up to +3V3_C: with the carrier unpowered it reads low."
